      "level": 1,
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": "好的 commit message 第一行应该？",
      "answer": "简短说明这次改了什么，必要时说明为什么",
      "explain": "例如：feat(learn): add start-learn queue ordering。",
      "tags": [
        "效率工具"
